,"shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4fSx_kno0HeGHwkFwO6TPQ","review_id":"P_aoSO6A-ZZ5V0swmQOLtw","date":"2019-12-06T03:01:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9539458751678467,"text_excerpt":"They just opened this week! So far, the service has been efficient and the lines moving quickly. I ordered the shack burger with American cheese, no pickles. It was good, albeit a little salty. I do have a sensitive palate to salt. The fries are ohhhh sooooo delicious!!! My favorite!!! Crinkly, light, crunchy, airy, divine! I love that they have the kiosks and you can use Apple Pay. You can also choose for here or to go. I did notice that as of 12/4 they were not yet on the app which was a bummer, but, may take a few days I guess. I had a chocolate shake; as always, my soul was so happy. Mmmm. Anytime I need my shake fix, I know I can go downstairs and have a delicious shake to sate my sw..."},{"business_id":"4fSx_kno0HeGHwkFwO6TPQ","review_id":"-Mqm0FE0vRTH8nCybrcjxA","date":"2020-03-04T16:47:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9318486452102661,"text_excerpt":"I had never visited shake shack before coming to this location when it first opened. I came for the media opening and wasn't expecting any or many options since I'm a vegetarian but was wrong! I enjoyed the 'shroom burger (crispy friend portobello mushroom filled with melted Muenster and cheddar cheese and topped with lettuce, tomato, and shacksauce). Boy oh boy this was good! Perfectly crispy and gooey. I also had the crinkle cut fries (how could I not?!) and they were great. With these, I dipped them in the concretes I tried. I honestly don't remember all the flavors I tried - I believe they were all featured flavors. One of the best parts is they serve alcohol!! Yay yay yay. The best o..."},{"business_id":"4fSx_kno0HeGHwkFwO6TPQ","review_id":"aZp8YgiijsoG_HHG6x_V-g","date":"2020-01-10T19:25:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9315663576126099,"text_excerpt":"I may be biased but when it comes to national fast/casual dining spot chains but I heavily lean towards Shake Shack and Whataburger. Shake Shack knocks it out of the park each and every time with my order. I really enjoy their menu. I love their burgers and those cheese fries are the reason I'll never be a 30 in jeans again. But eh I'm not complaining. Team is always friendly and I love the Luna Botanicals wall they feature! I'll be back when I'm craving their fries or an open faced dog."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4fSx_kno0HeGHwkFwO6TPQ","photo_id":"Dsq_2gWZUDoKFw2jo2BcTw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Dsq_2gWZUDoKFw2jo2BcTw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9155616164207458},{"business_id":"4fSx_kno0HeGHwkFwO6TPQ","photo_id":"Vf6Ajedxrujhm2tvRqZrjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Vf6Ajedxrujhm2tvRqZrjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8348052501678467},{"business_id":"4fSx_kno0HeGHwkFwO6TPQ","photo_id":"kBldqggnoHpXGoL8NpGEwg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kBldqggnoHpXGoL8NpGEwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8280178308486938}]},"notebook_case":null}
